  "claimed_state": "Typed SI prescribed convection velocity with exact constant, polynomial and PCHIP jets, input-content-bound in-memory restore and explicit projection. Spatial derivative is zero.",
  "verification": {
    "msvc": "Windows 11 x64, MSVC 19.51 Debug and Release, four selected CTest series. Debug companions at 2e871c16 and changed coupling series rerun at this final source, 34.79 seconds under the existing 60-second cap.",
